        ("Forward and decomposition", "1y1y forward = (1 + z₂)² ÷ (1 + z₁) − 1 on ANBIMA’s zero rates (vertices in business days ÷ 252). The two-year fall is split with ANBIMA’s own IPCA curve: share from inflation = change in implied inflation ÷ (change in implied inflation + change in real rate)."),
        ("Runoff arithmetic", "A finalist at share s of valid votes needs (50 − s) ÷ (share of the other candidates) of those candidates’ voters, holding turnout and blank votes constant."),
